# Aruco: Launch Detector Node

```
To launch the aruco detector node, we can use the provided launch file
(inside the lab3 pkg):
```
```
ros2 launch lab3 single.launch.py marker_id:=
marker_size:=0.
```
```
The launch file accepts some important parameters:
markerid: ID of the Aruco marker;
markersize: Size of the Aruco marker (in meters).
cameraframe: Name of the camera frame to use (default:
headfrontcamerargbopticalframe).
markerframe: Name of the marker frame to use (default:
arucomarkerframe).
```

