# Aruco: Important Topics

```
The aruco detector node publishes the following topics:
/arucosingle/debug: Image topic showing the processed image;
/arucosingle/result: Image topic showing the detected marker;
/arucosingle/marker: visualizationmsgs/msg/Marker;
/arucosingle/pixel: geometrymsgs/msg/PointStamped;
/arucosingle/position: geometrymsgs/msg/Vector3Stamped;
/arucosingle/pose: geometrymsgs/msg/PoseStamped;
/arucosingle/transform: geometrymsgs/msg/TransformStamped
```

