# LinkAttacher: Attach/Detach

```
Example of attaching/detaching the coca cola to the gripper of the
robot via ROS2 service calls.
```
```
Attachthe coca cola to the gripper of the robot:
ros2 service call
/ATTACHLINK linkattacher_msgs/srv/AttachLink "{
model1_name: ’tiago’, link1_name: ’gripper_left_finger_link’,
model2_name: ’coca_cola’, link2_name: ’link’}"
```
```
Detachthe coca cola from the gripper of the robot:
```
```
ros2 service call
/DETACHLINK linkattacher_msgs/srv/DetachLink "{
model1_name: ’tiago’, link1_name: ’gripper_left_finger_link’,
model2_name: ’coca_cola’, link2_name: ’link’}"
```
```
We can use Moveit or rqtjointtrajectorycontroller to move the robot
and check the behavior of the coca cola.
```

